  "topic": "CAN 总线仲裁为什么不会破坏高优先级报文？",
  "mascot_mode": "off",
  "factual_brief": {
    "schema_version": "1.0",
    "topic_digest": "91c2a7cd2b692884df3a7389e62c6ff4f940ddfc722b9c2edded2ba1dba17b09",
    "review_status": "verified",
    "facts": [
      {
        "fact_id": "can_dominant_recessive",
        "claim": "CAN 总线用 dominant 和 recessive 两种逻辑状态表示总线状态；dominant 位会覆盖同时出现的 recessive 位。",
        "source_ids": ["ti_can_intro", "nxp_can_arbitration"]
      },
      {
        "fact_id": "can_bitwise_arbitration",
        "claim": "多个节点同时发送时，节点逐位发送并回读总线；发送 recessive 却读到 dominant 的节点判定仲裁失败并停止发送。",
        "source_ids": ["ti_can_intro", "nxp_can_arbitration"]
      },
      {
        "fact_id": "can_identifier_priority",
        "claim": "标准 CAN 仲裁字段按标识符逐位比较；数值更低的标识符先出现 dominant 位，因此获得更高仲裁优先级。",
        "source_ids": ["nxp_can_blog", "nxp_can_arbitration"]
      },
      {
        "fact_id": "can_nondestructive_arbitration",
        "claim": "仲裁在报文头部完成，失败节点退出而获胜节点继续发送，获胜报文不会被同时发送的低优先级报文破坏。",
        "source_ids": ["ti_can_intro", "nxp_can_arbitration"]
      }
    ],
